===Etymology===
{{der|en|NL.|-}} {{m|mul|Velociraptor}} genus name, from {{af|la|vēlōx|gloss1=swift|raptor|gloss2=thief|nocat=1}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small [[agile]] [[dinosaur]], of the [[genus]] ''[[Velociraptor]]'', having [[sickle]]-[[shaped]] [[claw]]s. It is also thought to have had a feathered coat. Fossils have been found in Late Cretaceous deposits [[Mongolia]] and [[China]] (around 75-71 mya)

